pendent regulation of genes involved in the cell cycle</article-title><source>Mol Cell Biochem</source><year>1998</year><volume>181</volume><fpage>137</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9562250</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/A:1006890215502</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kaul</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Khosla</surname><given-names>VK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Molecular basis of 'cholesterol feedback lesion' in CNS tumors</article-title><source>Nerol India</source><year>2000</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>174</fpage><lpage>77</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maxfield</surname><given-names>FR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plasma membrane microdomains</article-title><source>Curr Opin Cell Biol</source><year>2002</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>483</fpage><lpage>87</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12383800</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0955-0674(02)00351-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simons</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Toomre</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Lipid rafts and signal transduction</article-title><source>Nat Rev Mol Cell Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>31</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11413487</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/35036052</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Allampallam</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Dutt</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Nair</surname><given-names>C</given-name